1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,060
Cantá, Brazilian Amazon.

2
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:04,030
Rosa just pulled up her cassava…

3
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:06,940
after the weakest rains since 1981.

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,430
Now, one question.

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,850
What do I plant next?

6
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,020
She asks.

7
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:14,430
Our assistant reads NASA satellite data for her land.

8
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,490
Rain, and soil.

9
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,180
She picks what matters.

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,150
Better soil?

11
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,450
Cowpea. It leaves the ground stronger.

12
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:23,380
Most tools chase profit, for big farms.

13
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:25,290
Ours lets small farmers choose…

14
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,750
and says what it doesn't know.

15
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,260
What to plant next.

16
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,720
For every small farm.
